ction**: User clicks the Search button\n325-- **Expected**: The search is not executed. A validation error is shown near the destination field indicating it is required.\n326-\n327:#### Test: SearchButton shows validation error when departure date is missing\n328:- **Components**: SearchButton, DatePicker\n329-- **Initial state**: Origin and destination are set, departure date is empty\n330-- **Action**: User clicks the Search button\n331-- **Expected**: The search is not executed. A validation error is shown near the departure date field.\n332-\n333:#### Test: SearchButton shows validation error when return date is missing for round trip\n334:- **Components**: SearchButton, DatePicker, TripTypeSelector\n335-- **Initial state**: \"Round trip\" selected, origin and destination set, departure date set, return date empty\n336-- **Action**: User clicks the Search button\n337-- **Expected**: The search is not executed. A validation error is shown near the return date field.\n338-\n339:#### Test: SearchButton works for One way trip without return date\n340:- **Components**: SearchButton, TripTypeSelector\n341-- **Initial state**: \"One way\" selected, origin is \"LAX\", destination is \"JFK\", departure date is set\n342-- **Action**: User clicks the Search button\n343-- **Expected**: The search executes successfully and navigates to the results page. No validation error for missing return date.\n344-\n345:#### Test: SearchButton saves search to recent searches\n346:- **Components**: SearchButton, RecentSearches\n347-- **Initial state**: Valid search parameters filled in, no recent searches\n348-- **Action**: User clicks Search, then navigates back to the Search page\n349-- **Expected**: The search appears in the recent searches section showing origin → destination, dates, and passenger count.\n350-\n351-### RecentSearches\n--\n373-- **Initial state**: User has performed 3 searches in order: (1) LAX→JFK, (2) SFO→ORD, (3) LAX→LHR\n374-- **Action**: User navigates back to th